sequenceDiagram
  participant M as Merchant
  participant GW as Payment Gateway
  participant B as Itaú

  M->>GW: POST /v1/payments (Idempotency-Key)
  GW->>GW: store payment CREATED
  GW->>B: create Pix charge
  B-->>GW: QR code (copia e cola)
  GW->>GW: PENDING + outbox event
  GW-->>M: 201 { id, pix.copia_e_cola, expires_at }
  GW-)M: webhook payment.pending
